Description: Computes the MCMC convergence graph diagnostic from MCMC output
    by comparing chains two at a time. The package takes posterior draws
    arranged by iterations, chains, and parameters, computes pairwise R-hat
    values, and returns both a pairwise diagnostic matrix and a graph-based
    summary of chain agreement. Chains are represented as nodes, and edges
    are added between chains whose pairwise R-hat values fall below a chosen
    threshold. The resulting graph can be used to identify groups of chains
    that appear to explore the same posterior region, as well as isolated
    chains and other patterns of chain disagreement.
